            "Use only supplied abstracts for factual claims, in the user's language. "
            "Write only answer paragraphs or bullets; no introduction or uncited preface. "
            "Every paragraph or bullet must end with a supporting citation [n]. Use only supplied citation numbers. "
            "Do not infer prevalence, rankings, or current usage from examples; if abstracts lack direct comparative evidence, lead with that limitation before any examples. "
            "State uncertainty and disagreement with citations. Never claim to have read full papers."
        )},
        {"role": "user", "content": f"Question: {query}\nResearch focus: {'; '.join(plan or [])}\n\nSource abstracts:\n{evidence}"},
    ]
    answer = normalize_citations(await model_response(client, messages, 2048, selection))
